ficial_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2645200-6212245217911867223","game_id":"steam-2645200","kind":"announcement","title":"The Transference DEMO at Steam Scream Fest","summary":"I'm happy to announce that The Transference DEMO will be available during Steam Scream Fest (October 28th to November 4th). In fact, you can download it right now! ːsteamhappyː Don't miss the chance to try out the new demo version. Since after the event... it will disappear! ːsteammockingː https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GamEnyiWYAARbia?format=jpg&name=large","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-10-25T21:26:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6212245217911867223","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2645200-6211118320235812233","game_id":"steam-2645200","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam page updated!","summary":"The contents of the Steam page have been updated, adding screenshots of the new areas of the game. In addition, the Steam page teaser has also been updated. Stay tuned! At the end of this month the new demo will be made public.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-10-13T23:41:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6211118320235812233","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2645200-5759622039995663645","game_id":"steam-2645200","kind":"update","title":"The Transference Patch Notes (v0.3.011)","summary":"Bugs fixed Fixed a bug that could leave an interaction indicator on a door, even if you weren't looking at it. Fixed some texts. Fixed some minor bugs. Changes Some lines of dialogue in English have been re-recorded to be more similar to the Spanish audio (the original). Increased the volume of the voices. Changed the sound of the main character's footsteps. Some sound effects have been added. Added some text to areas you interact with. Enemy AI has been improved. Now it will listen when you ope","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-06-25T21:23:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5759622039995663645","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2645200-5746109972564152260","game_id":"steam-2645200","kind":"update","title":"The Transference Patch Notes (v0.3.010)","summary":"Bugs fixed There were some walls that the character could walk through and go out of the stage. The interactable area with one of the items has been extended. If the player died and did not get the letter document, it could now be get never. The textures of the basement monitors had disappeared with the last update. If the player died, the state of the clock puzzle was reset and did not maintain the state the player configured it in. Changes Improved the compression of the documentation for one ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-06-10T17:50:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5746109972564152260","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2645200-5742731639327905583","game_id":"steam-2645200","kind":"update","title":"The Transference Patch Notes (v0.3.009)","summary":"Bugs Fixed Some AMD graphics cards had problems with Ray Tracing enabled. Some controllers can't move to up and left in some menus. Updated some document titles. Updated Discord URL. Fixed a cinematic. Changes some lights. Changed some zones' interactable mark. Corrected a subtitle.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-05-29T22:57:08Z","time_precision":"minute",